invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_ext.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: an unknown critical extension is skipped instead of refused, so
  a critical nameConstraints the mode cannot honour, and the CT poison
  extension of a precertificate, pass unread. The corpus row
  critical_name_constraints and the critical mutants object.

--- old
        return ext.critical ? off_profile(alert) : CH_OK;
--- new
        return CH_OK;
